<title>USA: Burlington Coat Factory extends shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Burlington Coat Factory extends shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, N.J. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burlington Coat Factory Warehouse Corp said Friday it expanded its stock repurchase program by authorizing an additional $10 million to be spent.</p>
<p>The program will continue through Jan. 10, 1999.</p>
<p>To date, the company has repurchased 1,053,300 shares of its common stock, $1.00 par value, under the program that began in October.</p>
